<fw type="sig" place="bottom">U 2</fw><fw type="catch" place="bottom">Der</fw><lb/>
<pb n="308" facs="#f0334"/>
<p>Der Ge&#x017F;andte ha&#x0364;tte kein Franzo&#x017F;e und<lb/>
